Credit: BRINKO is built on MARK XXV, a JARVIS-style Python voice assistant from the open-source
"Jarvis Mark" series by FatihMakes (https://www.youtube.com/@FatihMakes), released under CC BY-NC 4.0.
BRINKO adds the Gemini 3.x live voice, the blue star HUD, camera mode, the phone app, document builder,
memory, and many other changes.

Bundled third-party files keep their own licenses:
  - MediaPipe Tasks Vision (fx/vendor, fx/models): Apache License 2.0, Google LLC
  - Vosk small English model (models/vosk-model-small-en-us-0.15): Apache License 2.0, Alpha Cephei Inc.
